        <segment id="1" parent="7" relname="concession">Even though the approaches deemed best are based on what has worked successfully.</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="7" relname="span">I definately can tell that most of the concepts underlying their approach to design are based design in application to almost any industry.</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="2" relname="evidence">From taking a look at the bigger picture before deciding on cost facor decisions to the multidisciplinarian side of things.</segment>
